sequenceDiagram
    participant Entry as Entry Gateway
    participant M1 as Mix Layer 1
    participant M2 as Mix Layer 2
    participant M3 as Mix Layer 3
    participant Exit as Exit Gateway

    Entry->>M1: Sphinx Packet
    M1->>M1: Decrypt layer
    M1->>M1: Verify HMAC
    M1->>M1: Random delay
    M1->>M2: Sphinx Packet
    M2->>M2: Decrypt layer
    M2->>M2: Verify HMAC
    M2->>M2: Random delay
    M2->>M3: Sphinx Packet
    M3->>M3: Decrypt layer
    M3->>M3: Verify HMAC
    M3->>M3: Random delay
    M3->>Exit: Sphinx Packet
